## Rules

- Single inheritance: one `extends` per class.
- Every class ultimately extends `Object`, which provides `toString`, `equals` and `hashCode`.
- `final class` cannot be extended; a `final` method cannot be overridden.
- `protected` members are visible to subclasses.

